      "why": "INP = input delay + processing + presentation. Here nearly all of it is processing: event callbacks (plus React’s synchronous re-render) ran for ~590ms before the browser could paint. Moving filtering server-side again, chunking with scheduler.yield(), or useDeferredValue for the results fixes it.",
